{
  "$comment": [
    "Apple's required-reason API categories, transcribed as data so the iOS",
    "scan is auditable and updatable without touching code (PRD §12.2 step 10).",
    "A hit means the shipped library imports an API in that category, which",
    "means the app that links it needs a PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy declaring a",
    "reason for it.",
    "",
    "Transcribed by hand from the Apple documentation named in `source`, on",
    "`transcribed_on`. There is no network access in this repository's tooling",
    "(AGENTS.md rule 3), so this file is a transcription, not a fetch; re-check",
    "it against the page when the harness is next revised.",
    "",
    "`c_symbols` are the C entry points a Mach-O actually imports and is what",
    "the nm -u scan matches; `objc_classes` are matched through their",
    "_OBJC_CLASS_$_/_OBJC_METACLASS_$_ import symbols. `documented_apis` are",
    "the API names Apple lists, including the Foundation/Swift spellings that",
    "do not appear as undefined symbols in a C library; they are recorded so",
    "the category is complete and so a reviewer can see what was and was not",
    "scannable."
  ],
  "source": "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/BundleResources/privacy-manifest-files/describing-use-of-required-reason-api",
  "transcribed_on": "2026-09-08",
  "matching": {
    "input": "nm -u -arch <arch> <binary>",
    "normalisation": [
      "strip one leading underscore (Mach-O C symbol prefix)",
      "strip a trailing $INODE64, $UNIX2003, $NOCANCEL, $1050 or $DARWIN_EXTSN variant suffix",
      "read _OBJC_CLASS_$_<Name> and _OBJC_METACLASS_$_<Name> as the class <Name>"
    ]
  },
  "categories": [
    {
      "id": "NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategoryFileTimestamp",
      "name": "File timestamp APIs",
      "c_symbols": [
        "fgetattrlist",
        "fstat",
        "fstat64",
        "fstatat",
        "fstatat64",
        "getattrlist",
        "getattrlistat",
        "getattrlistbulk",
        "lstat",
        "lstat64",
        "stat",
        "stat64"
      ],
      "objc_classes": [],
      "documented_apis": [
        "creationDate",
        "modificationDate",
        "fileModificationDate",
        "contentModificationDateKey",
        "creationDateKey",
        "getattrlist",
        "getattrlistat",
        "getattrlistbulk",
        "fgetattrlist",
        "stat",
        "fstat",
        "fstatat",
        "lstat",
        "NSFileCreationDate",
        "NSFileModificationDate",
        "NSURLContentModificationDateKey",
        "NSURLCreationDateKey"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "NSPrivacyAccessedAPICategorySystemBootTime",
      "name": "System boot time APIs",
      "c_symbols": ["mach_absolute_time", "mach_continuous_time"],
      "objc_classes": ["NSProcessInfo"],
      "documented_apis": [
